Hi everyone!

The other day I got an easily implementable idea for a new item:

     A bar of soap.

It should help you getting (cursed) rings off your fingers at the 
cost of one charge.  The bar of soap should be a rare item with no 
more than three charges, so it does not destroy game balance.

Two (optional) side effects would be:

1) stepping on a bar of soap would let you (or any ol' monster) trip 
   and fall;

2) applying the soap to yourself (washing it's called in the real world :-)
   would temporarily (!) raise your charisma by a point or two depending
   on the blessed/cursed status: c: -1 r: +1  b: +2.  This would give better
   prices.

Well, what d'ya think?

